WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.230
A desk.

2
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.960
Two closed books with blank spines.

3
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.750
One empty title line,
and a cursor, blinking.

4
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.230
A title is typed,
deleted, and typed again.

5
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.760
Three times, and each
time it changes shape.

6
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:15.830
Same books.

7
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.200
Three titles.

8
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.530
Which one works?

9
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.890
And how could you tell, before
you've written a single word?

10
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:26.360
In this mission, you'll find that
every board's NEA has its own rules,

11
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.180
so you check those first.

12
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.940
You'll ask what makes
two books a good pair.

13
00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.670
Is a shared topic enough?

14
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.430
And you'll take a strong question
apart, to see what it's made of.

15
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.360
Your mission: work out what
makes an NEA question good.
